---
---

<aside class="editorial-sidebar" aria-label="Quick directory links">
  <!-- Quick Tools Card -->
  <div class="sidebar-card">
    <div class="sidebar-header">
      <span class="header-icon" aria-hidden="true">✨</span>
      <h3 class="header-title">Naming Tools</h3>
    </div>
    <div class="sidebar-body">
      <div class="tools-list">
        <a href="/tools/name-generator" class="tool-link-item">
          <div class="tool-icon-circle">🎲</div>
          <div class="tool-meta">
            <strong class="tool-name">Name Generator</strong>
            <span class="tool-desc">Find matching Korean first names</span>
          </div>
        </a>
        <a href="/tools/favorite-names" class="tool-link-item">
          <div class="tool-icon-circle">⭐</div>
          <div class="tool-meta">
            <strong class="tool-name">Saved Favorites</strong>
            <span class="tool-desc">Review your bookmarked list</span>
          </div>
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- Browse by Gender & Category -->
  <div class="sidebar-card">
    <div class="sidebar-header">
      <span class="header-icon" aria-hidden="true">🏷️</span>
      <h3 class="header-title">Explore by Category</h3>
    </div>
    <div class="sidebar-body">
      <div class="category-chips-grid">
        <a href="/gender/girl" class="cat-pill pill-girl">🌸 Girl Names</a>
        <a href="/gender/boy" class="cat-pill pill-boy">👦 Boy Names</a>
        <a href="/gender/unisex" class="cat-pill pill-unisex">✳️ Unisex Names</a>
        <a href="/surname" class="cat-pill pill-surname">👑 Korean Surnames</a>
        <a href="/hanja" class="cat-pill pill-hanja">📜 Hanja Dictionary</a>
        <a href="/theme/wisdom" class="cat-pill pill-theme">💡 Wisdom Names</a>
        <a href="/theme/nature" class="cat-pill pill-theme">🌱 Nature Names</a>
        <a href="/theme/grace" class="cat-pill pill-theme">✨ Grace Names</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- Cultural Note Card -->
  <div class="sidebar-card cultural-card">
    <div class="cultural-badge">Korean Culture Note</div>
    <p class="cultural-text">
      In Korean naming tradition, given names usually feature two Sino-Korean syllables chosen to balance harmonious virtues and familial generation characters (Dollimja).
    </p>
    <a href="/acknowledgments" class="cultural-link">Learn about naming rules &rarr;</a>
  </div>
</aside>

<style>
  .editorial-sidebar {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 1.5rem;
  }

  .sidebar-card {
    background: var(--bg-surface);
    border: 1px solid var(--border-color);
    border-radius: var(--radius-md);
    box-shadow: var(--shadow-xs);
    overflow: hidden;
  }

  .sidebar-header {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.5rem;
    padding: 0.75rem 1rem;
    background: var(--brand-teal-light);
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--brand-teal-border);
  }

  .header-icon {
    font-size: 1rem;
  }

  .header-title {
    font-size: 0.875rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: var(--brand-teal-deep);
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.03em;
    margin: 0;
  }

  .sidebar-body {
    padding: 1rem;
  }

  .tools-list {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 0.65rem;
  }

  .tool-link-item {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.75rem;
    padding: 0.5rem 0.6rem;
    border-radius: var(--radius-sm);
    transition: background-color 0.15s ease;
  }

  .tool-link-item:hover {
    background-color: var(--brand-teal-surface);
  }

  .tool-icon-circle {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    width: 34px;
    height: 34px;
    background: var(--bg-secondary);
    border: 1px solid var(--border-color);
    border-radius: var(--radius-full);
    font-size: 1rem;
    flex-shrink: 0;
  }

  .tool-meta {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
  }

  .tool-name {
    font-size: 0.875rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: var(--brand-teal-deep);
  }

  .tool-desc {
    font-size: 0.75rem;
    color: var(--text-muted);
  }

  .category-chips-grid {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 0.45rem;
  }

  .cat-pill {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    padding: 0.35rem 0.65rem;
    border-radius: var(--radius-full);
    font-size: 0.775rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    border: 1px solid var(--border-color);
    background: var(--bg-surface);
    color: var(--text-body);
    transition: all 0.15s ease;
  }

  .cat-pill:hover {
    border-color: var(--brand-teal);
    background: var(--brand-teal-surface);
    color: var(--brand-teal-deep);
  }

  .pill-girl:hover { border-color: var(--gender-girl); color: var(--gender-girl); }
  .pill-boy:hover { border-color: var(--gender-boy); color: var(--gender-boy); }
  .pill-unisex:hover { border-color: var(--gender-unisex); color: var(--gender-unisex); }

  .cultural-card {
    padding: 1.25rem;
    background: linear-gradient(180deg, var(--bg-surface) 0%, var(--brand-teal-surface) 100%);
  }

  .cultural-badge {
    display: inline-block;
    font-size: 0.7rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--brand-teal-deep);
    background: var(--brand-teal-light);
    border: 1px solid var(--brand-teal-border);
    padding: 0.15rem 0.5rem;
    border-radius: var(--radius-full);
    margin-bottom: 0.65rem;
  }

  .cultural-text {
    font-size: 0.8125rem;
    color: var(--text-body);
    line-height: 1.5;
    margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
  }

  .cultural-link {
    font-size: 0.775rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: var(--brand-teal-deep);
  }

  .cultural-link:hover {
    text-decoration: underline;
  }
</style>
